  "verification": "Scoped ROM and CONTROLLED_ORIGINAL_STATE_EXPERIMENT plus existing controller-only normal Boss reference; Android proof is separate",
  "limitations": [
    "All fresh original probes load the existing controlled-estate state and write explicit HP/maxHP/inventory/status fixtures. Not new normal-play evidence.",
    "Forcing the sole actor dead while a command is already open is unreachable in valid single-character battle: original confirms/consumes then skips the dead actor. No claim that cancellation refunds this forced-invalid state. UI refuses a dead current actor. Other dead party targets remain outside scope.",
    "First probe failed because installed FCEUX exposes registerexec but not registerread; corrected hooks use observed scoped PCs, not another emulator.",
    "Magic AFB5 scaling table is unrelated to medicine9384; not used for herb."
  ]
